          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On the morning of November 8, 1978, several witnesses in different departments observed the rapid passage in the sky of a luminous phenomenon. According to the descriptions of the witnesses, this object was followed by a colored trail in the sky and moved according to a descending trajectory. The presumed locations of the object's fall were searched, but no ground traces were discovered. These witnesses likely witnessed an atmospheric reentry.",
